      "mergedPostDetails": "I've encountered an issue where PhysBone components exhibit erratic movement exclusively in my local client when animating VRC ParentConstraint Weight from 0→1. Other players in the same instance observe normal behavior.\n\nIssue Details:\n\n- I'm using ParentConstraint to temporarily change a hood's bone parent from Head to Chest during an equip/unequip animation\n\n- When the animation transitions the Weight value from 0 to 1, the PhysBone components attached to the hood violently distort on my local client\n\n- This behavior is completely invisible to other players in the same instance, who see the expected smooth transition\n\n- The issue persists across multiple client builds, including the most recent update\n\navatar id: avtr_15cb07b8-1a0e-4af3-9c0c-2deedeb3e1af",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1626] PhysBone Erratic Behavior When Changing ParentConstraint Weight (Local Client Only)",
