      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was advised by anatawa12-san that it might be a head chop issue, so I implemented it and it worked fine!\n\nIt seems that there was a lack of consideration when transferring from Head to another bone with ParentConstraint.\n\nThis was my lack of study...",
